OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fthe chance of an odd shower in the
OL,7,Fnorth at first otherwise mostly dry
OL,8,Fwith clear spells. Frosty with mist or
OL,9,Ffog patches later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FMostly dry and bright
OL,12,Fbecoming cloudy in the north later
OL,13,Fwith blustery, locally heavy and
OL,14,Fwintry showers in the far north
OL,15,Ftowards the evening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCold
OL,18,Fwith blustery and wintry showers in
OL,19,Fthe north Thursday. Less cold and
OL,20,Fmostly dry but cloudy Friday. Dry at
OL,21,Ffirst, rain south later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
